<https://wikicitadel.example.org/citation/c0001> wk:pageLine "21"^^xsd:integer .
<https://wikicitadel.example.org/citation/c0001/selector> a oa:TextQuoteSelector .
<https://wikicitadel.example.org/citation/c0001/selector> oa:exact "One correction, the same day, and it overrides the sentence above wherever\nthe two conflict: that direction covers work, never decisions. Every\ndecision — what to adopt, what to publish, what to spend, what to delete —\nneeds my own approval, asked for one at a time." .
<https://wikicitadel.example.org/citation/c0001/selector> oa:prefix "— without asking me\neach time.\n\n" .
