<https://wikicitadel.example.org/citation/c0002/selector> oa:exact "I am setting up this wiki because I do not want the agent's working memory\nto live inside the agent, where I cannot see it, check it, or hand it to\nanother agent. Everything the agent knows about my work should live here,\nin plain files under version control, with the source of every claim\nattached to the claim." .
