<https://wikicitadel.example.org/citation/c0003> wk:pageLine "26"^^xsd:integer .
<https://wikicitadel.example.org/citation/c0003/selector> a oa:TextQuoteSelector .
<https://wikicitadel.example.org/citation/c0003/selector> oa:exact "To keep things moving I am giving a blanket direction: the agent may\nproceed with the work — reading, filing, building — without asking me\neach time.\n" .
